experiment h4_A3_mimo16:
objective: H4 stage 2 (h4_plan.md, addendum 2026-11-07), only if A1 passes. Base + projection of the MiMo delta on MiMo's own top-16 residual directions, alpha 1, all layer matrices.
budgets:
    allow_write = true
    max_modified_weights = 9000000000
steps:
    step subspace_transfer tensors=model.layers.* source=hf_cache/mimo-distill-hf basis=sig:lab/runs/delta_patterns/sig_mimo.pt k=16 alpha=1.0 out=hf_cache/h4/A3-hf
